lang/rust/cxlib/target/
# V compile-cache objects. `-usecache` (CX_CACHE in the Makefile) C-compiles
# each unchanged module once and reuses the object; the layer is machine- and
# toolchain-specific and fully regenerable. 227 of these (2.5 MB of
# `*.module.net.mbedtls.o` plus `.thirdparty.description.txt` siblings) were
# committed by accident in dee871be (2026-04-20) and untracked at #841: a cut
# was shipping opaque binaries nobody reviewed, and every content gate that
# scans tracked files was reporting `Binary file … matches` noise on them —
# which is exactly the kind of output that trains a reader to skim a gate.
.cache/
lang/v/.cache/

# compiled V binaries
vcx/tests/conformance_run
vcx/tests/runners/conformance/conformance_run
lang/v/examples/transform
lang/v/examples/demo

# Language binding build artifacts (active)
lang/rust/cxlib/target/

